(Modern C++20 Custom Polymorphic Memory Resources) Tj T*
(High-Frequency Trading and Low-Latency Systems Architecture) Tj T*
(1. Memory Allocation Overhead in Real-Time Systems) Tj T*
(Standard heap allocations via malloc/new introduce variable latency due to kernel calls and heap fragmentation.) Tj T*
(2. Custom Arena Pool Allocator Implementation) Tj T*
(template <typename T, size_t BlockSize = 4096>) Tj T*
(class FixedArenaAllocator {) Tj T*
(public:) Tj T*
(  using value_type = T;) Tj T*
(  T* allocate\(size_t n\) {) Tj T*
(    if \(offset_ + n * sizeof\(T\) > BlockSize\) throw std::bad_alloc\(\);) Tj T*
(    T* ptr = reinterpret_cast<T*>\(&buffer_[offset_]\);) Tj T*
(    offset_ += n * sizeof\(T\);) Tj T*
(    return ptr;) Tj T*
(  }) Tj T*
(  void deallocate\(T* p, size_t n\) noexcept { /* no-op in arena */ }) Tj T*
(private:) Tj T*
(  alignas\(std::max_align_t\) std::byte buffer_[BlockSize];) Tj T*
(  size_t offset_{0};) Tj T*
(};) Tj T*
(3. Performance Benchmark Summary) Tj T*
(Arena allocation achieves O\(1\) allocation speed with zero heap locks.) Tj T*
